    "Id": "chassisdef_dyrnwyn_DYR-C",
    "Name": "Dyrnwyn",
    "Details": "Developed to fill the Society's need for a high-performance jumping unit, the Dyrnwyn is a 35-ton OmniMech derived from the Incubus II. An Interface Cockpit and advanced Partial Wing system provide exceptional mobility, with the split-wing design offering improved control while remaining compact enough to fold for transport. Intended primarily for elite front-line forces, the Dyrnwyn demands considerable skill from its MechWarrior to fully exploit its exceptional aerial mobility.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Nimble</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.03</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
